WEBVTT

00:08:28.694 --> 00:08:30.273
We don't care.

00:08:32.428 --> 00:08:35.043
We don't care until
we are personally affected.

00:08:35.729 --> 00:08:38.420
I mean, we know.
We know climate change is real.

00:08:38.444 --> 00:08:41.012
We know that we face
drastic and dramatic change.

00:08:41.036 --> 00:08:42.526
We know that it is coming fast.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.359
Yet most of us

00:08:45.662 --> 00:08:48.947
act as if everything were normal.

00:08:50.359 --> 00:08:51.724
So we must care,

00:08:52.726 --> 00:08:54.308
all of us,

00:08:54.332 --> 00:08:59.046
and if you can't care for those who are
affected by the melting of glaciers,

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.033
you should at least care for yourself.